## Citation

If you use this framework in academic work, please cite the associated article as the primary reference:

D. Maymó-Calatayud, A. Monaco, J. Lopez-Xarbau, and M. Faundez-Zanuy,
"HandAQUS: A Multimodal Acquisition and Synchronization Framework for Handwriting and Gaze Signals."
  WIRN'2026, Vietri sul Mare (Salerno, Italy) 9th-13th June 2026

The software archive is additionally available in Zenodo:
DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.19617252
